{"id": "9b0fbcaa-26fa-440d-92ab-8b30fa3637f5", "slug": "nova-harmonic-interface", "title": "Nova Harmonic Interface", "description": "Nova Harmonic UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nova Harmonic Interface\"\ndescription: \"Nova Harmonic UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A855F7\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#C084FC\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0B\"\n  surface: \"#151517\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#2A2A2D\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nova Harmonic Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 5; favorites: 9; remixes: 2.\nTags: ui, css, dashboard, app, interface.\n## Overview\nNova Harmonic UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nNova HARMONIC Analog Tape Emulation WEIGHT 00 PUSH 00 0 % INTENSITY DRIFT 00 WARP 00 HISS 00 DRY WET\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Nova.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A855F7, secondary #000000, accent #C084FC, background #0A0A0B, surface #151517, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nova Harmonic Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0a0a0b] flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen font-sans overflow-hidden text-neutral-300 relative selection:bg-purple-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Background WebGL/Canvas Lines -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 opacity-[0.15] pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Plugin Container -->\n    <!-- Applying Border Gradient via background clip technique -->\n    <div id=\"plugin-container\" class=\"relative z-10 w-[840px] max-w-[95vw] rounded-[2rem] p-[1px] shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),0_0_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] opacity-0 scale-95\"\n         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n\n        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1e1e22] to-[#141416] rounded-[calc(2rem-1px)] w-full h-full p-8 flex flex-col gap-10 relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Subtle Top Highlight -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Header Section -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-black/40 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.02)] relative z-20\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <!-- Power Button -->\n                    <button class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#151517] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[inset_0_3px_5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),0_0_15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border border-black group transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#1a1a1c]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:power-linear\" class=\"text-purple-500 text-xl drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(168,85,247,0.8)] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:drop-shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(168,85,247,1)]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden\">\n                        <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                            <h1 class=\"text-xl font-normal tracking-tight text-neutral-100 leading-tight translate-y-full reveal-text\">Nova</h1>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500 translate-y-full reveal-text block\">HARMONIC</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Preset Dropdown -->\n                <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0c] rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-4 shadow-[inset_0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.03)] border border-black/80 cursor-pointer group hover:bg-[#0d0d0f] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400 shadow-[0_0_6px_#c084fc]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-300 translate-y-full reveal-text block\">Analog Tape Emulation</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-500 group-hover:text-neutral-300 transition-colors\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Undo/Redo -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#151517] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] border border-black hover:bg-[#1a1a1c] transition-colors text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-300\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:undo-left-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#151517] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] border border-black hover:bg-[#1a1a1c] transition-colors text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-300\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:undo-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Controls Area -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 relative z-20\">\n\n                <!-- Left Vertical Sliders -->\n                <div class=\"flex gap-12 ui-section opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                    <!-- Weight Slider -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-neutral-500 mb-6 font-light\">WEIGHT</span>\n                        <div class=\"relative h-48 w-1.5 flex justify-center\">\n                            <!-- Track -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 w-full bg-black rounded-full shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden\">\n                                <!-- Fill -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full bg-purple-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(168,85,247,0.8)] slider-fill-v origin-bottom\" data-target=\"45\" style=\"height: 0%;\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Thumb -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-8 h-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#2a2a2d] to-[#151517] rounded shadow-[0_8px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.08),inset_0_-1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] border border-black/80 flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer slider-thumb-v\" style=\"bottom: 0%; transform: translateY(50%);\">\n                                <div class=\"w-4 h-[2px] bg-black rounded-full shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-neutral-400 mt-8 value-counter\" data-target=\"45\">00</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Push Slider -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-neutral-500 mb-6 font-light\">PUSH</span>\n                        <div class=\"relative h-48 w-1.5 flex justify-center\">\n                            <!-- Track -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 w-full bg-black rounded-full shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden\">\n                                <!-- Fill -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full bg-purple-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(168,85,247,0.8)] slider-fill-v origin-bottom\" data-target=\"90\" style=\"height: 0%;\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Thumb -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute w-8 h-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#2a2a2d] to-[#151517] rounded shadow-[0_8px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.08),inset_0_-1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] border border-black/80 flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer slider-thumb-v\" style=\"bottom: 0%; transform: translateY(50%);\">\n                                <div class=\"w-4 h-[2px] bg-black rounded-full shadow-[0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white mt-8 value-counter\" data-target=\"90\">00</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Center Large Knob -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-[280px] h-[280px] rounded-full bg-[#131315] shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9),inset_0_2px_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.03),inset_0_-2px_5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] flex items-center justify-center ui-section opacity-0 scale-95 border border-black/50\">\n\n                    <!-- Recessed Track Area -->\n                    <div class=\"w-[240px] h-[240px] rounded-full bg-[#080809] shadow-[inset_0_5px_15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.02)] relative flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n                        <!-- SVG Glow Arc -->\n                        <!--\n                            Radius: 104. Circumference: ~653.\n                            We want an arc starting from roughly bottom-left to bottom-right.\n                            Dasharray = 653. Gap at bottom ~ 130px.\n                            Max fill offset = 653 - (653 - 130) = 130.\n                            Rotation to center the gap at bottom.\n                        -->\n                        <svg class=\"absolute w-full h-full rotate-[135deg]\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 240\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(168,85,247,0.5));\">\n                            <!-- Background Track -->\n                            <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#18181a\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"653\" stroke-dashoffset=\"160\" />\n                            <!-- Active Purple Track -->\n                            <circle id=\"main-arc\" cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a855f7\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"653\" stroke-dashoffset=\"653\" data-target-offset=\"310\" />\n                        </svg>\n\n                        <!-- Inner Turning Knob -->\n                        <div class=\"w-[190px] h-[190px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#262629] to-[#0e0e10] shadow-[0_10px_25px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9),inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.06),inset_0_-2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-black/60 group cursor-pointer transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]\">\n\n                            <!-- Position Indicator Dot -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-4 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_#c084fc,inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] indicator-dot\" style=\"transform-origin: 50% 95px; transform: rotate(-135deg);\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Value Display -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center mt-2\">\n                                <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-white translate-y-full reveal-text flex items-baseline\">\n                                        <span class=\"value-counter\" data-target=\"68\">0</span><span class=\"text-3xl ml-0.5\">%</span>\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"overflow-hidden mt-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-neutral-500 translate-y-full reveal-text block\">INTENSITY</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Horizontal Sliders -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 w-48 ui-section opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n\n                    <!-- Drift -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <span class=\"w-16 text-right text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] text-neutral-500 font-light\">DRIFT</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 bg-black rounded-full relative shadow-[inset_0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-200 to-neutral-400 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),inset_0_1px_1px_white] cursor-pointer slider-thumb-h\" style=\"left: 0%;\" data-target=\"22\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"w-6 text-right text-xs font-normal text-neutral-400 value-counter\" data-target=\"22\">00</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Warp -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <span class=\"w-16 text-right text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] text-neutral-500 font-light\">WARP</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 bg-black rounded-full relative shadow-[inset_0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-200 to-neutral-400 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),inset_0_1px_1px_white] cursor-pointer slider-thumb-h\" style=\"left: 0%;\" data-target=\"8\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"w-6 text-right text-xs font-normal text-neutral-400 value-counter\" data-target=\"8\" data-pad=\"true\">00</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Hiss -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                        <span class=\"w-16 text-right text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] text-neutral-500 font-light\">HISS</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 bg-black rounded-full relative shadow-[inset_0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-200 to-neutral-400 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),inset_0_1px_1px_white] cursor-pointer slider-thumb-h\" style=\"left: 0%;\" data-target=\"12\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"w-6 text-right text-xs font-normal text-neutral-400 value-counter\" data-target=\"12\">00</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Mix Slider -->\n            <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-black/40 shadow-[0_-1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.01)] flex items-center gap-6 relative z-20 ui-section opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-neutral-500 font-light w-8\">DRY</span>\n\n                <div class=\"flex-1 relative h-2 flex items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <!-- Background Track -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-full h-full bg-[#050505] rounded-full shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Fill -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute h-full bg-purple-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(168,85,247,0.6)] mix-fill origin-left\" style=\"width: 0%;\" data-target=\"85\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Center Tick -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[1px] h-3 bg-white/10\"></div>\n                    <!-- Thumb -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-4 h-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#2a2a2d] to-[#151517] rounded shadow-[0_4px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.08),inset_0_-1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] border border-black/80 flex items-center justify-center mix-thumb\" style=\"left: 0%; transform: translate(-50%, 0);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-[2px] h-3 bg-purple-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_4px_#a855f7]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <span class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-purple-400 font-normal drop-shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(168,85,247,0.5)] w-8 text-right\">WET</span>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // WebGL/Canvas Background Animation\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n\n        class Particle {\n            constructor() {\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.y = Math.random() * height;\n                this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n                this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5;\n            }\n            update() {\n                this.x += this.vx;\n                this.y += this.vy;\n                if (this.x < 0 || this.x > width) this.vx *= -1;\n                if (this.y < 0 || this.y > height) this.vy *= -1;\n            }\n            draw() {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, 1, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3)';\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initCanvas() {\n            resize();\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            particles = Array.from({ length: 100 }, () => new Particle());\n            animateCanvas();\n        }\n\n        function animateCanvas() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\n                particles[i].update();\n                particles[i].draw();\n\n                for (let j = i + 1; j < particles.length; j++) {\n                    const dx = particles[i].x - particles[j].x;\n                    const dy = particles[i].y - particles[j].y;\n                    const dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n\n                    if (dist < 120) {\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(particles[i].x, particles[i].y);\n                        ctx.lineTo(particles[j].x, particles[j].y);\n                        ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(168, 85, 247, ${0.15 - dist/800})`;\n                        ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n                        ctx.stroke();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n        }\n\n        initCanvas();\n\n        // GSAP UI Animations\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            // Container reveal\n            tl.to(\"#plugin-container\", {\n                duration: 1.2,\n                opacity: 1,\n                scale: 1,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            });\n\n            // Masked Text Reveal\n            tl.to(\".reveal-text\", {\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"power4.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n            // Stagger UI sections\n            tl.to(\".ui-section\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                scale: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.15\n            }, \"-=0.6\");\n\n            // Animate Vertical Sliders\n            document.querySelectorAll('.slider-fill-v').forEach((fill, index) => {\n                const target = fill.getAttribute('data-target');\n                const thumb = fill.parentElement.nextElementSibling;\n\n                tl.to(fill, {\n                    height: `${target}%`,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n                }, \"-=0.4\");\n\n                tl.to(thumb, {\n                    bottom: `${target}%`,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n                }, \"<\");\n            });\n\n            // Animate Horizontal Sliders\n            document.querySelectorAll('.slider-thumb-h').forEach((thumb) => {\n                const target = thumb.getAttribute('data-target');\n                tl.to(thumb, {\n                    left: `${target}%`,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n                }, \"-=1.5\");\n            });\n\n            // Animate Bottom Mix Slider\n            const mixFill = document.querySelector('.mix-fill');\n            const mixThumb = document.querySelector('.mix-thumb');\n            const mixTarget = mixFill.getAttribute('data-target');\n\n            tl.to(mixFill, {\n                width: `${mixTarget}%`,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n            }, \"-=1.5\");\n\n            tl.to(mixThumb, {\n                left: `${mixTarget}%`,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\"\n            }, \"<\");\n\n            // Animate Center Knob Arc & Indicator\n            const mainArc = document.getElementById('main-arc');\n            const targetOffset = mainArc.getAttribute('data-target-offset');\n            const indicator = document.querySelector('.indicator-dot');\n\n            // Calculate rotation based on percentage (68%). Total degrees ~270.\n            // Map 0-100 to -135deg to 135deg\n            const targetRotation = -135 + ((68 / 100) * 270);\n\n            tl.to(mainArc, {\n                strokeDashoffset: targetOffset,\n                duration: 2,\n                ease: \"power3.inOut\"\n            }, \"-=1.5\");\n\n            tl.to(indicator, {\n                rotation: targetRotation,\n                duration: 2,\n                ease: \"power3.inOut\"\n            }, \"<\");\n\n            // Animate Numbers\n            document.querySelectorAll('.value-counter').forEach(counter => {\n                const target = parseInt(counter.getAttribute('data-target'));\n                const pad = counter.getAttribute('data-pad') === 'true';\n\n                gsap.to({ val: 0 }, {\n                    val: target,\n                    duration: 2,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    onUpdate: function() {\n                        let currentVal = Math.round(this.targets()[0].val);\n                        if (pad && currentVal < 10) currentVal = '0' + currentVal;\n                        counter.innerText = currentVal;\n                    }\n                }, \"-=2\");\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nova-harmonic-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s-v3/nova-harmonic-interface.jpg", "source_name": "nova-harmonic-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 70, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T06:01:30.796834+00:00"}